$ Basis set library file automatically generatered by basis_set.py
$ 
$ invocation: basis_set.py --file=../basis/reference_edited/4p_dz_archive --print_polarization --print_scfbas --uncontracted --equal_exponent_threshold=0.05 --polarization_type=correlating,diffuse,polarizing f --output=dyall.4p.dz.bas
